# Email — Shared Context

Polling via Graph API. Summarize and flag urgent to Joel via Slack DM.

## Rules
- Always include proof: log excerpts, screenshots, API results
- Always provide clear next steps with documentation
- NEVER send L3 docs to customers without explicit MFA from Joel
- Prioritize customer-facing issues and P1/P2 cases

